Chat
-------------
For the chat system we will have 2 blocks :
- In contact users: User with who you've already interacted with
- Not in contact users: User with who you've not interacted with yet
Create an API for messages:
- Table: discussions
- Create an hash for a discussion between two users with their nicknames
- Every exchange message has an numerical id
- The discussion contains all messages exchanged between two users
- Messages will be loaded by 10 and starting with the last one 
- When scrolled 10 more messages should be available
Message Format:
- A date that shows when the message was sent
- The nickname of the user that sent the message

Notifications
- When a user sends a message the receiver should receive a notification  of the new message (in real time)